cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Adaptive Residual-Correction FEM Reproducibility Package"
message: "If you use this software or its numerical results, please cite this release."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-23
authors:
  - family-names: Zalloum
    given-names: Othman H. Y.
    affiliation: Palestine Polytechnic University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7282-1332"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ozalloum/adaptive-residual-correction-fem"
url: "https://github.com/ozalloum/adaptive-residual-correction-fem"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for numerical experiments on global residual-correction
  equivalence, active-subspace energy recovery, halo-localized residual correction,
  residual-controlled halo selection, and residual-based adaptive finite elements
  for scalar elliptic problems. The package contains the production numerical solver,
  verification scripts, machine-readable results, repeated timing data, regenerated
  figures, and environment metadata.
keywords:
  - adaptive finite element method
  - residual correction
  - local defect correction
  - a posteriori error estimation
  - Dörfler marking
  - subspace correction
  - verification and validation
  - reproducible computing
